  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Autonomy of Rural Women of Cauca</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action builds on the pilot project financed by the European Parliament, run by the Alpina Foundation, Mercy Corps and local partners COMFACAUCA and CAFICAUCA. This phase, proposed with the same partners, aims at transforming the disparities of rural women compared to men in terms of income generation as well as to preventing and reducing Sexual and Gender Based Violence (SGBV) through strengthening the autonomy and economic and social empowerment of 1,120 rural women in 10 municipalities of</narrative>
  </description>
